      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STICKY MANGO (1) is drawn well on the inside. Latest effort finished 4th on July 15 over 300m at Murray Bridge Straight behind Zinfandel Zoom beaten 9 lengths (17.84) in a Maiden. Suited here and can find winning form. LEGEND BLUE BUZZ (2) crossed over from out wide last start before finishing second (20.67) at this track in a Maiden over 342m. Expected to be in this for a long way. CRUSTY DUSTY (7) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fourth (21.02) last time in a Maiden at this track. Cannot be underestimated. REGAL REBA (8) cannot be written off despite a miss here at her latest outing.",
